      "locked": false,
      "text": "WAP to create a class called Box having three int memebers length, \nbreadth, height along with following methods and constructor.\n\n1. non parametrized constructor to initialize all fields with 0.\n\n2. Parameterized constructor which takes 1 arg as int and initialize all elements \nwith it.\n\n3. triple paramatrized constructor which initializes fields with these arg.\n\n4. copy constructor which takes Box object as arg and initializes \nnew Box object with passed arg.\n\n5. A method  show which display the fields of object.\n---------->> 15Box.java",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WAP to create a class called Box having three int memebers length, \nbreadth, height along with following methods and constructor.\n\n1. non parametrized constructor to initialize all fields with 0.\n\n2. Parameterized constructor which takes 1 arg as int and initialize all elements \nwith it.\n\n3. triple paramatrized constructor which initializes fields with these arg.\n\n4. copy constructor which takes Box object as arg and initializes \nnew Box object with passed arg.\n\n5. A method  show which display the fields of object.\n---------->> 15Box.java",
